{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あけましておめでとう\nございます( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え。ぶろぐ更新するの遅いって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ごめんなさい(´;ω;`)\n実家に帰ってまったり\nしてました(´;ω;`)う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今日は幕張メッセで\n全国握手会でした！\n1st 2nd....と新しくリリース\nするごとにファンの方が増えてくれて\nるのが凄くわかります( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く嬉しいです。\nありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの綺麗なサイリウムに\n囲まれて歌うのが凄く楽しいです。\n振ってくれてありがとう！\nちゃんと後ろのほうまで\n見えてるんですよ♡えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のペアはまりっかと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/05/8879511/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはね、髪切って少しだけ\n大人っぽいな。って思ったんだけど\n実物でみるとやっぱり童顔ちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこが可愛いんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのまりっか推しの方とも\nたくさんお喋りが出来て\n楽しかったです( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか推しの方、\nうるさかったらごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうだ謝るといえば\nかなりん推しの方も\n自己紹介の時に盛り上がって\nかなりんの自己紹介マネして\nごめんなさい(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も握手会すごい楽しみだな♡\n明日はお約束どうりの\nパジャマだよ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしといてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまた明日ね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/05/8879511/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/01/05/8879511/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ございました( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたんと\nべびたんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}